#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-te.rst:101
#: 2eda6de1873a4f42bb4e49ef41ac1972
msgid "ESP ELRS Receiver or ESP WIFI Telemetry"
msgstr "ESP ELRS 接收机或 ESP WIFI 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-te.rst:103
#: 8a84a6a35dff40c9966be9f6fa7b83a9
msgid ""
"The Matek F405-WTE includes an ESP8285 processor that can be flashed to "
"provide either ELRS RC/Telem Receiver onboard, or to provide ESP WIFI "
"Telemetry. See the `setup and flashing instructions "
"<https://www.mateksys.com/?portfolio=f405-wte#tab-id-5>`__ provided on the "
"Mateksys website."
msgstr ""
"Matek F405-WTE 包含一颗 ESP8285 处理器，可烧录固件以提供 ELRS RC/数传机载接收机，或提供 ESP WIFI "
"数传功能。详情请参阅 Mateksys 官网的 `设置与烧录说明 "
"<https://www.mateksys.com/?portfolio=f405-wte#tab-id-5>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-te.rst:107
#: 86f060b75d204dde84f3a953fae15364
msgid "Camera and Supply Switch"
msgstr "摄像头与供电切换"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-te.rst:109
#: e9d37b8ee2224d749c562c6f0aaace06
msgid ""
"Switching between the two camera inputs, C1 (default on) or C2, and between "
"on (default) and off of Vsw (jumper selectable supply) on some boards, can "
"be implemented using the Relay function of ArduPilot and assigning the "
"relays to an ``RCx_OPTION`` switch on the transmitter."
msgstr ""
"可通过 ArduPilot 的继电器功能在两路摄像头输入 C1（默认开启）或 C2 之间切换，以及在部分板上的 "
"Vsw（跳线可选供电）的开启（默认）与关闭之间切换，并将继电器分配给遥控器上的 ``RCx_OPTION`` 开关。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-te.rst:111
#: 6c9341a236154294883d13f4d8f61b52
msgid ""
"some boards implement one or the other of the camera switch and video power "
"supply switch,instead of both, but those boards bring the controlling GPIO "
"pin out to a pad for use externally."
msgstr "部分板型仅实现摄像头切换或视频供电切换其中之一，但这些板会将控制 GPIO 引脚引出至焊盘供外部使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-te.rst:113
#: 9a265bae32024784b97983b68b495daf
msgid ""
"Set the ``RELAYx_PIN`` to \"81\" for on/off of Vsw, and to \"82\" to control"
" the camera switching. Then select an RC channel for control (Chx) and set "
"its ``RCx_OPTION`` to the appropriate Relay (1-4) that you had set its pin "
"parameter above."
msgstr ""
"将 ``RELAYx_PIN`` 设为 「81」用于 Vsw 的开关控制，设为 「82」用于摄像头切换控制。然后选择一个 RC "
"通道（Chx）进行控制，并将其 ``RCx_OPTION`` 设置为上述已设定引脚参数的对应继电器（1-4）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-te.rst:116
#: f538516605544d8a908c6fa31880e91d
msgid ""
"For example, use Channel 10 to control the camera switch using Relay 2:"
msgstr "例如，使用通道 10 通过继电器 2 控制摄像头切换："

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-te.rst:118
#: 8450c6cf4bc04335991ec2d21efd1503
msgid ":ref:`RELAY2_PIN<RELAY2_PIN>` = \"82\""
msgstr ":ref:`RELAY2_PIN<RELAY2_PIN>` = 「82」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-te.rst:119
#: 2fefe4b6f2944b1d9ac8558da4fb7600
msgid ":ref:`RC10_OPTION<RC10_OPTION>` = \"34\" (Relay2 Control)"
msgstr ":ref:`RC10_OPTION<RC10_OPTION>` = 「34」（继电器 2 控制）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-te.rst:121
#: 22ef0d2258e5493aad5b2c3d578f5286
msgid ""
"setting Relay on/high assigned for Vsw will turn off that supply. Likewise, "
"setting on/high for the Relay assigned for camera, will switch from Camera 1"
" to Camera 2."
msgstr "将分配给 Vsw 的继电器设为开/高电平将关闭该供电。同样，将分配给摄像头的继电器设为开/高电平将从摄像头 1 切换到摄像头 2。"

